<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Bricks Scholarships — A permanent fund for FIRST students</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bricks Scholarships converts retired FIRST robotics equipment into a permanent, self-sustaining scholarship fund for graduating FIRST students.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --princeton-orange:#ff8811;
    --jasmine:#f4d06f;
    --floral-white:#fff8f0;
    --pearl-aqua:#9dd9d2;
    --space-indigo:#392f5a;
    --glass-fill: rgba(43,35,68,0.92);
    --glass-fill-soft: rgba(43,35,68,0.85);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    background:var(--floral-white);
    color:var(--space-indigo);
    font-family:'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk','Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }

  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.75rem;}
  .wrap-narrow{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.75rem;}

  .tag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--pearl-aqua);
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.5rem;
  }
  .tag::before{
    content:'';
    width:6px;height:6px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--pearl-aqua);
    box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--pearl-aqua);
  }

  /* ---------- scroll reveal (fade + rise + settle) ---------- */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(34px) scale(0.97);transition:opacity .75s ease, transform .75s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1);}
  .reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
  .reveal-delay-1{transition-delay:.08s;}
  .reveal-delay-2{transition-delay:.16s;}
  .reveal-delay-3{transition-delay:.24s;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;} }

  /* ---------- floating dark glass panel ---------- */
  .glass{
    position:relative;
    background:linear-gradient(165deg, var(--glass-fill), var(--glass-fill-soft));
    border-radius:20px;
    backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
    box-shadow:
      0 30px 60px -20px rgba(57,47,90,0.35),
      0 10px 24px -10px rgba(57,47,90,0.25),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    overflow:hidden;
    color:var(--floral-white);
    transition:transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
  }
  .glass::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:45%;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.14), transparent);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .glass:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow:
      0 40px 75px -20px rgba(57,47,90,0.4),
      0 14px 28px -10px rgba(57,47,90,0.3),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
  .glass h2, .glass h3{color:var(--floral-white);}
  .glass p{color:rgba(255,248,240,0.72);}

  /* ---------- glossy pill button ---------- */
  .btn-glossy{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.5rem;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, #4a3d73, var(--space-indigo));
    color:var(--floral-white);
    border:none;
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:0.85rem 1.8rem;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    text-decoration:none;
    box-shadow:0 14px 28px -8px rgba(57,47,90,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .btn-glossy:hover, .btn-glossy:focus-visible{
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow:0 18px 34px -8px rgba(57,47,90,0.55), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }
  .btn-glossy::after{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;top:0;left:-70%;width:40%;height:100%;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.25), transparent);
    transform:skewX(-20deg);
    transition:left .6s ease;
  }
  .btn-glossy:hover::after{left:130%;}

  .btn-outline{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.5rem;
    background:rgba(57,47,90,0.04);
    color:var(--space-indigo);
    border:1.5px solid rgba(57,47,90,0.25);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:0.8rem 1.7rem;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover, .btn-outline:focus-visible{
    border-color:var(--space-indigo);
    background:rgba(57,47,90,0.06);
  }

  /* ---------- ambient glow field (soft light behind glass) ---------- */
  .glow-field{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
  .glow-orb{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(90px);opacity:0.5;}
  @keyframes driftA{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0);}50%{transform:translate(40px,-30px);}}
  @keyframes driftB{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0);}50%{transform:translate(-35px,25px);}}
  .glow-orb.a{animation:driftA 22s ease-in-out infinite;}
  .glow-orb.b{animation:driftB 26s ease-in-out infinite;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .glow-orb{animation:none !important;} }

  /* ---------- image placeholder (on dark glass) ---------- */
  .img-placeholder{
    position:relative;
    border-radius:16px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0 1px, transparent 1px 32px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0 1px, transparent 1px 32px),
      rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    min-height:220px;
  }
  .img-placeholder svg{width:38px;height:38px;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.35);}
  .img-placeholder .ph-label{
    position:absolute;bottom:14px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(255,248,240,0.4);
  }

  /* ---------- floating nav ---------- */
  nav{
    position:fixed;top:1.1rem;left:0;right:0;z-index:20;
    display:flex;justify-content:center;
    padding:0 1.5rem;
  }
  nav .nav-inner{
    width:100%;max-width:1080px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:0.85rem 1.5rem;
    background:var(--glass-fill);
    border-radius:999px;
    backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
    box-shadow:0 20px 45px -18px rgba(57,47,90,0.45), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.65rem;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--floral-white);letter-spacing:0.01em;}
  .brand svg{width:24px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0;}
  nav ul{display:flex;gap:2rem;list-style:none;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.02em;}
  nav a{text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.72);transition:color .2s ease;}
  nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--floral-white);}
  @media (max-width:760px){ nav ul{display:none;} }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:96vh;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
    padding:9rem 0 4rem;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3.5rem;justify-content:space-between;z-index:1;}
  .hero-copy{max-width:640px;padding:3rem;}
  .hero-copy .tag{color:var(--pearl-aqua);margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
  .hero-copy .tag::before{background:var(--pearl-aqua);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--pearl-aqua);}
  h1.hero-headline{
    font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4.6vw,3.2rem);
    line-height:1.16;
    color:var(--floral-white);
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:1.5rem;
    max-width:50ch;
    font-size:1.02rem;
    color:rgba(255,248,240,0.72);
  }
  .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:2.25rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-actions .btn-outline{color:var(--floral-white);border-color:rgba(255,248,240,0.35);}
  .hero-actions .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--floral-white);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}

  .hero-module{
    flex-shrink:0;
    width:260px;height:260px;
    perspective:1100px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .cube3d{
    width:170px;height:170px;
    position:relative;
    transform-style:preserve-3d;
    animation:spin3d 26s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin3d{from{transform:rotateX(-16deg) rotateY(0);}to{transform:rotateX(-16deg) rotateY(360deg);}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .cube3d{animation:none;transform:rotateX(-16deg) rotateY(28deg);} }
  .cube3d .face{
    position:absolute;width:170px;height:170px;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(57,47,90,0.85), rgba(57,47,90,0.65));
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    box-shadow:0 20px 45px -15px rgba(57,47,90,0.4);
  }
  .cube3d .face::after{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.16), transparent 55%);
  }
  .cube3d .face::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;left:10%;right:10%;top:50%;height:1px;
    background:rgba(157,217,210,0.55);
    box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(157,217,210,0.6);
  }
  .cube3d .front{transform:translateZ(85px);}
  .cube3d .back{transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(85px);}
  .cube3d .right{transform:rotateY(90deg) translateZ(85px);}
  .cube3d .left{transform:rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(85px);}
  .cube3d .top{transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(85px);}
  .cube3d .bottom{transform:rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(85px);}

  @media (max-width:880px){
    .hero .wrap{flex-direction:column;text-align:center;}
    .hero-actions{justify-content:center;}
  }

  /* ---------- telemetry / stats ---------- */
  .telemetry{position:relative;padding:6rem 0;}
  .telemetry .kicker-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:3rem;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;}
  .telemetry .kicker-row h2{color:var(--space-indigo);font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;}
  .telemetry .tag{color:var(--space-indigo);}
  .telemetry .tag::before{background:var(--princeton-orange);box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,136,17,0.5);}
  .stats-grid{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;}
  .stat-card{padding:2.1rem 1.75rem;}
  .stat-code{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.45);letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .stat-num{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,2.8rem);font-weight:700;color:var(--floral-white);line-height:1;}
  .stat-label{font-size:0.88rem;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.62);margin-top:0.6rem;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- mission ---------- */
  .mission-section{padding:2rem 0 6rem;}
  .mission-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;gap:0;}
  .mission-text{padding:3.5rem;}
  .mission-text .tag{margin-bottom:1.25rem;}
  .mission-text h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem);margin-bottom:1.5rem;}
  .mission-text p{margin-bottom:1.1rem;font-size:1rem;max-width:56ch;}
  .mission-visual{position:relative;padding:1.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem 0;display:flex;}
  .mission-visual .img-placeholder{flex:1;}
  @media (max-width:820px){
    .mission-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .mission-text{padding:2.5rem 2.5rem 1rem;}
    .mission-visual{padding:1.5rem 2.5rem 2.5rem;}
  }

  /* ---------- how it works ---------- */
  .process{padding:6rem 0;}
  .process .kicker-row{margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .process h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);color:var(--space-indigo);max-width:30ch;}
  .process-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1.25rem;margin-top:2.5rem;}
  .process-card{padding:1.9rem 1.6rem;}
  .process-num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--pearl-aqua);margin-bottom:1.1rem;}
  .process-card h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:0.6rem;font-weight:600;}
  .process-card p{font-size:0.9rem;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .process-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .process-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- story ---------- */
  .story{padding:6rem 0;}
  .story .kicker-row{margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .story h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.2vw,2.2rem);color:var(--space-indigo);max-width:24ch;margin-bottom:2.5rem;}
  .story-visual{margin-bottom:2.5rem;min-height:240px;}
  .timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem;}
  .timeline-item{position:relative;padding:1.75rem 1.9rem;}
  .timeline-item::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--pearl-aqua), var(--princeton-orange));
    border-radius:3px 0 0 3px;
  }
  .timeline-year{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.76rem;color:var(--pearl-aqua);letter-spacing:0.06em;margin-bottom:0.5rem;text-transform:uppercase;}
  .timeline-item p{max-width:64ch;font-size:0.98rem;}

  /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
  .faq{padding:6rem 0;}
  .faq .kicker-row{margin-bottom:2.5rem;}
  .faq h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);color:var(--space-indigo);}
  .faq-item{margin-bottom:1.1rem;padding:0;}
  .faq-item summary{
    cursor:pointer;list-style:none;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;
    padding:1.4rem 1.75rem;
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;color:var(--floral-white);
  }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .faq-item summary .icon{
    width:24px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--pearl-aqua);
    transition:transform .2s ease;
  }
  .faq-item[open] summary .icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
  .faq-item .faq-body{padding:0 1.75rem 1.6rem;font-size:0.95rem;max-width:64ch;}

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */
  .contact{padding:2rem 0 8rem;}
  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  .contact-copy{padding:3.5rem;}
  .contact-copy .tag{margin-bottom:1.25rem;}
  .contact-copy h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem);margin-bottom:1.1rem;}
  .contact-copy p{max-width:44ch;}
  .contact-details{padding:3.5rem;border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:1.5rem;}
  .contact-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;}
  .contact-row .icon-box{
    width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:10px;flex-shrink:0;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .contact-row .icon-box svg{width:19px;height:19px;color:var(--pearl-aqua);}
  .contact-row .label{font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.5);}
  .contact-row .value{font-weight:600;color:var(--floral-white);}
  .contact-row a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;}
  @media (max-width:820px){
    .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .contact-copy, .contact-details{padding:2.5rem;}
    .contact-details{border-left:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);}
  }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{position:relative;padding:1rem 1.75rem 3rem;}
  .footer-inner{
    max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem;
    padding:2rem 2.5rem;
  }
  .footer-brand{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--floral-white);letter-spacing:0.01em;}
  .footer-links{display:flex;gap:1.75rem;list-style:none;font-size:0.82rem;}
  .footer-links a{text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.55);transition:color .2s ease;}
  .footer-links a:hover, .footer-links a:focus-visible{color:var(--floral-white);}
  .footer-fine{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;color:rgba(255,248,240,0.4);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#9dd9d2" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <path d="M8 12h8M12 8v8" stroke="#9dd9d2" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      Bricks Scholarships
    </div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#mission">Mission</a></li>
      <li><a href="#story">Our Story</a></li>
      <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn-glossy" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="glow-field" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="glow-orb a" style="width:420px;height:420px;top:-10%;left:0%;background:var(--pearl-aqua);"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb b" style="width:360px;height:360px;bottom:-10%;right:5%;background:var(--jasmine);"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy glass reveal">
      <span class="tag">FIRST Alumni Network</span>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">Building the next chapter of students' lives, one forgotten brick at a time.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Bricks Scholarships converts retired FIRST robotics equipment into a permanent, self-sustaining scholarship fund for graduating FIRST students who have the drive for college but not the means.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn-glossy" href="#contact">Donate your bricks</a>
        <a class="btn-outline" href="#mission">View the mission</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-module reveal reveal-delay-2" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="cube3d">
        <div class="face top"></div>
        <div class="face front"></div>
        <div class="face back"></div>
        <div class="face right"></div>
        <div class="face left"></div>
        <div class="face bottom"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="telemetry">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker-row reveal">
      <span class="tag">Fund Status</span>
      <h2>Where things stand today</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card glass reveal">
        <div class="stat-code">DATA / 01</div>
        <div class="stat-num">45</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Years of combined FIRST experience</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card glass reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="stat-code">DATA / 02</div>
        <div class="stat-num">3</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Founders, one shared mission</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card glass reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="stat-code">DATA / 03</div>
        <div class="stat-num">2027</div>
        <div class="stat-label">First scholarships awarded</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mission-section" id="mission">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mission-grid glass reveal">
      <div class="mission-text">
        <span class="tag">Mission Statement</span>
        <h2>A sustainable fund for students who need it most.</h2>
        <p>Bricks Scholarships is a network of FIRST alumni on a mission to award scholarships to graduating FIRST students who are motivated and capable of furthering their education but lack the support or financial means to do so.</p>
        <p>With your team's help, we collect neglected and formerly used FLL sets and use them as the capital for an investment fund, creating a sustainable, self-sufficient source of financial support for students in perpetuity.</p>
        <p>We plan for the first scholarships to begin paying out starting the 2027 school year, with applications and reviews taking place during the 2027 Michigan State Competition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-visual">
        <div class="img-placeholder">
