    </details>
    <details class="faq-item glass reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <summary>When do scholarships start paying out?<span class="icon">+</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-body">We plan for the first scholarships to begin paying out starting the 2027 school year, with applications and reviews taking place during the 2027 Michigan State Competition.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item glass reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <summary>Who is eligible to apply?<span class="icon">+</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-body">Graduating FIRST students who are motivated and capable of furthering their education but lack the financial means or support to do so. Full application details will be shared ahead of the 2027 review period.</div>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item glass reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <summary>Is Bricks Scholarships affiliated with the LEGO Group or FIRST?<span class="icon">+</span></summary>
      <div class="faq-body">No. We're an independent, alumni-run scholarship fund built by former FIRST participants — not an official program of FIRST or the LEGO Group.</div>
